Rust dependencies
=============================================================================

The `stepv` binary statically links Rust crates from crates.io, all under
permissive licenses (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, zlib, or Unicode). The exact list
with full license texts is produced from Cargo.lock by
`cargo about generate about.hbs` (cargo-about is in the dev shell).
